#. ふぅ、それにしても…
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Hmm..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いくつか発見はあったけど、
#. 手掛かりどころか、妙な発見ばっかりだったな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I discovered lots of stuff. And it was all strange.\n"
"But I dunno if any of it was an actual clue...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんだか混乱してきたし…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'm just getting more confused.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 食堂で…みんなに相談してみた方がいいかもな…
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Maybe I should head to the dining hall and talk about\n"
"it with everyone else..."
msgstr ""

#. …いったん食堂に戻ろうかな。
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "For now, I should head to the dining hall."
msgstr ""
